  GarbhSheetDay(36, 'My darling child, your tiny heart is beating so fast and strong today, full of pure life. My own heart answers yours with absolute love and joy. Rest beautifully in my warmth; your heartbeat is the sweetest song I have ever heard.', 'I am listening closely to your journey, little soul. As your tiny heart beats with so much life today, know that my heart beats to protect you and your mother forever. You are our absolute rhythm.', 'The Horse and the Hidden Saddle', 'A proud horse wanted to drive a swift deer away from his green field. He asked a hunter for help. The hunter said, "If you let me put a leather seat on your back and a rope in your mouth, I will help you win." The horse agreed and won the fight, but found he could no longer remove the heavy saddle, losing his freedom forever to the hunter.', 'Do not sacrifice your core freedom, peace, and internal balance just to win a small argument.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(37, 'Today, your little arms are forming joints, and your elbows are appearing. You are becoming more defined and unique every single day. I am moving gently and keeping myself relaxed. I love you so much, my precious baby.', 'Your father is waiting to hold you close, my little child. Every single day, I am working hard to build a soft, safe, and happy cushion of life for you to land on. Grow beautifully.', 'The Bear and the Two Friends', 'Two friends walking through a jungle saw a large bear coming. One quickly climbed a tree, leaving the other behind. The second friend lay flat on the ground, holding his breath completely still. The bear sniffed his ear and walked away, thinking he was dead. The first friend climbed down and asked, "What did the bear whisper?" He replied, "Avoid friends who walk away when things get tough."', 'True protection and loyalty are measured in times of silent support and standing together.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(38, 'Deep inside your little jaw, the very first foundations for your sweet smile are forming today. I am keeping my meals rich and healthy for you. I look forward to the day I hear your sweet babble and laughter.', 'A beautiful smile is a gift of joy, little one. Your father promises to always speak kindly, share laughter with you, and show you the brightest, most cheerful side of life. Rest deeply.', 'The Smart Pigeons and the Net', 'A hunter spread grains and a hidden net over the grass. A flock of pigeons flew down eagerly to eat, getting trapped instantly. While the young birds cried in panic, the old leader said, "Do not waste your energy fighting alone. We must coordinate our movements. Lift off together at the count of three!" They flapped as one, flying up safely together with the net.', 'Coordinated effort and clear, shared direction can break through any trap of trouble.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(39, 'Your little system is gently folding and shaping with perfect intelligence today. I am treating my body like a quiet sanctuary, staying completely calm and rested for you. You are being built with absolute perfection.', 'Your physical well-being is my greatest priority, little baby. Your father is making sure your mother has no stress and no hard chores today. We are protecting your growing space with all our might.', 'The Lion and the Three Bulls', 'Three strong bulls always ate grass together in a green field, keeping each other safe. A fierce lion wanted to hunt them but knew their combined strength was too much. He began whispering false stories to each bull separately. The bulls grew suspicious, stopped standing together, and separated. Alone, they lost their balance and protection, and the lion caught them easily.', 'Trust and harmony build a protective shield that internal fights and suspicion easily destroy.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(40, 'Tiny, invisible movements are starting inside your quiet home today, even though you are still too small for me to feel. You are becoming so active and strong! I am sending you a soft, loving hug through my thoughts.', 'Grow active and brave, my child. Your father is sending you thoughts of energy and physical resilience today. Take all the time you need and rest beautifully in the soft warmth your mother provides.', 'The Clever Deer in the Trap', 'A beautiful deer got his foot caught in a hunter\'s rope trap. Instead of moving wildly, panicking, and hurting his legs, he took a deep breath and lay down completely flat on the grass. He let his body go loose and held his breath. The hunter arrived, thought the deer was already dead, and untied the rope. Instantly, the deer sprang up and ran away safely.', 'Remaining completely calm and relaxed in a tight spot allows wisdom to find a safe way out.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(41, 'The beautiful pathways for your senses are initializing today. I am enjoying the sweet scent of flowers and the fresh morning air, sharing all this goodness with you. Your world is full of beauty and light, my child.', 'The world has so many wonders waiting for you, little one. Your father cannot wait to show you the beauty of nature, the sky, and the stars. Rest comfortably today, you are deeply loved.', 'The Two Singing Birds', 'Two birds sat on a high wire, singing a beautiful morning song together. A cat crept up underneath them, trying to catch their attention by making strange, loud noises. One bird stopped singing to look down out of curiosity, losing its balance. The second bird kept its eyes fixed on the safe sky, continuing its steady song, remaining perfectly secure and safe.', 'Keep your core focus fixed on positive things; ignore the negative distractions that pull you down.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(42, 'Look at us, my little baby—six wonderful weeks together! You are growing with so much grace and strength inside me. I am so happy to be your mother, and I bless you with all my heart today.', 'Six weeks of loving you, my little child! Your father is filled with gratitude today. We are getting everything ready for your beautiful future, and we are so incredibly proud of you.', 'The Monkey King\'s Bridge', 'A great army of hunters cornered a large group of monkeys on a high cliff by a deep river. The monkey king leaped across to a tree on the other side, tying a strong vine to his waist to form a bridge for his friends. He held the vine tightly, enduring deep physical pressure, until every single monkey crossed safely to freedom.', 'True leadership and core strength lie in protecting and supporting those who rely on your care.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(43, 'Your tiny fingers and toes are starting to separate and show themselves clearly today. I am placing my hand gently on my belly, sending you waves of pure love and comfort. You are a true miracle growing inside me.', 'It is your father, little soul. I am touching your mother\'s belly and sending you all my warmth. I am waiting for the day your tiny fingers wrap around mine. Grow beautifully today.', 'The Wise Man and the Elephant', 'Four men met a gentle elephant for the first time in the dark. The first touched the leg and said, "An elephant is like a thick tree pillar." The second held the tail and said, "No, it is like a rope." The third touched the side and claimed it was a wall. A wise man came and explained they each held only a small piece of truth, and needed to combine their views to see the whole animal.', 'Listen to others with an open mind; complete internal balance requires seeing the full picture.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(44, 'Inside your tiny body, your own systems are stepping up to create life-force and health today. You are becoming so independent and strong. I am resting deeply, keeping my mind full of bright, happy thoughts just for you.', 'You carry the strength of our family lineage within you, little one. Your father is standing right here, keeping all worries away from your mother, making sure your life flows with perfect peace.', 'The Bird and the Big Net', 'A hunter used a clever whistle to catch a flock of small birds in his big net. The wise leader of the birds told them, "The moment the net drops, let us balance our weight, flap our wings together, and lift it onto a nearby thorn bush!" They did this successfully every day, lifting the heavy net and escaping safely without any hurt.', 'Shared effort and balanced communication dissolve any external problem with absolute ease.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(45, 'Your little ears are shaping beautifully today, preparing to hear the world. I am speaking to you in my softest, most loving voice, telling you how precious you are to me. Let my voice be your sweet comfort.', 'Can you hear me, my little baby? It is your father speaking. I want my voice to be a symbol of absolute safety and love for you throughout your entire life. We are right here with you.', 'The Clever Tiny Fish', 'A fisherman caught a tiny little fish in his big net. The tiny fish looked up and begged, "Please throw me back! I am too small to feed anyone today. Let me grow big, and you can catch me again next year." The fisherman smiled at his clever words but kept him, knowing a small, real gain today is better than a big empty promise tomorrow.', 'Appreciate and hold onto the real, steady blessings you have right in front of you.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(46, 'Soft cartilage is beginning to turn into strong foundation bones across your body today. I am keeping my posture relaxed and filling my body with good nutrition. May you grow up to be sturdy, brave, and resilient.', 'Your father is sending you thoughts of physical strength and stamina today, little one. I am making sure our home is a peaceful, happy sanctuary so you get the best environment to build your strength.', 'The Donkey in the Lion\'s Clothes', 'A lazy donkey found a hunter\'s discarded lion skin. He put it on and walked into the village, watching everyone run away in fear. Filled with pride, the donkey thought he was truly a king. He opened his mouth to roar proudly, but a loud bray came out instead, revealing his true self. The villagers returned and chased him away.', 'True character and strength are revealed through your genuine voice, never through a false look.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(47, 'Your little eyes are being covered by sweet, protective folds today, keeping them safe in your quiet world. I am keeping my mind completely calm, visualizing soft colors and beautiful spaces for you. Rest deeply, my baby.', 'Your vision and your peace are safe with us, my child. Your father promises to protect your path, guide your steps, and always show you the way of honesty and light. Sleep warmly.', 'The Greedy Farmer and the Goose', 'A greedy farmer owned a wonderful goose that laid one solid golden egg every single morning. Wanting to get rich all at once, he thought, "There must be a big box of gold inside her!" He harmed the bird, only to find she was completely ordinary inside, losing his daily blessing and his structural balance forever.', 'Greed and over-rushing destroy the steady, quiet blessings that nourish our daily life.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(48, 'Your internal defense and cleansing system is stepping into place today. I am drinking lots of pure water and keeping my body clean and relaxed. You are growing in a completely pure, loving, and happy environment.', 'Your absolute purity is our priority, little baby. Your father is keeping our entire home full of positive vibes, light, and happiness just for you. You lack nothing in your first home.', 'The Dog and the Reflection', 'A dog walked across a narrow wooden bridge carrying a juicy bone in his mouth. Looking down into the clean, clear river, he saw his own shadow in the water and mistook it for another dog with a larger bone. Filled with sudden greed, he opened his mouth to bark angrily, and his own bone fell into the water, vanishing instantly.', 'Remaining content and happy with your blessings keeps your foundation rich and peaceful.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(49, 'Seven beautiful weeks have passed since you came into my life, my child! Look how much you have achieved and grown. I am so proud of how my body is protecting you. You are my greatest blessing.', 'Seven weeks of this beautiful journey, my little child. Your father is overflowing with love and gratitude today. We are stronger and happier because of you, and we love you endlessly.', 'The Blue Crane\'s Real Voice', 'A crane fell into a big bucket of blue paint while searching for food. Emerging entirely bright blue, the other birds made him their king out of awe. The crane became proud, ignoring his old friends. One evening, a flock of cranes flew overhead, calling out. The blue crane instinctively answered with his real voice, losing his disguise and his crown.', 'Authentic character is always revealed through your true voice, never through a fake mask.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(50, 'My sweet baby, today we mark a huge step as your main foundation is completely set. Every essential part of you is now in its right place. I am taking a long, deep breath of gratitude. You are built for a long, healthy, and beautiful life.', 'You are a champion already, little soul. Your father is celebrating your incredible growth today. I promise to work hard every single day to build a beautiful, secure, and happy life for you to step into.', 'The Baby Crab and His Mother', 'A mother crab looked at her young child and said, "Why do you always walk sideways, my child? You should walk straight forward with pride!" The young crab smiled gently and replied, "Dear mother, please walk straight ahead in front of me first, showing me the perfect balance, and I will happily follow your steps."', 'Setting a gentle, balanced, and positive example speaks louder than a thousand rules.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(51, 'Your little shoulders, hips, and knees are fully set in place today, preparing for a life of movement. I am staying relaxed and comfortable, sending gentle thoughts of flexibility and ease to your body. You are growing beautifully.', 'Grow strong and flexible, my child. Your father is here to support all your movements and your future dreams. I am wrapping your mother in complete comfort today so you get the best energy.', 'The Traveler and the Three Tricks', 'A traveler was carrying a healthy goat on his shoulders. Three clever thieves saw him and decided to trick him. One by one, they met him on the road and said, "Why are you carrying a dirty dog on your shoulders?" Doubting his own senses and losing his confidence, the traveler panicked, dropped the goat, and ran away.', 'Stay confident in your own clear vision and truth; do not let outside voices confuse your inner peace.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(52, 'A soft, beautiful protective layer of skin is beginning to cover your tiny body today. I am caring for my own skin and body with deep love, knowing it shields you perfectly. You are enveloped in complete warmth and safety.', 'You are surrounded by love from all sides, little one. Your father is making sure your mother is smiling, relaxed, and happy today. We are protecting your beautiful inner world together.', 'The Two Owls in the Storm', 'Two proud young owls lived on a high branch, always boasting about who could fly higher into the dark sky. One night, a massive storm came into the jungle. One owl hid inside a hollow tree trunk, while the other tried to fight the wind proudly. The storm broke his wings, while the quiet owl stayed completely safe.', 'Seeking shelter in quiet, flexible wisdom protects your core when big storms arise.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(53, 'Your internal cleansing system is softly starting its natural work today, keeping your inner world pure. I am keeping my diet simple, clean, and filled with natural goodness just for you. You are growing in absolute purity, my child.', 'Purity and health are our promises to you, little baby. Your father is taking care of every small need for your mother today so she can stay completely relaxed and happy for you.', 'The Tree and the Travelers', 'Two exhausted travelers sat under the cool shade of a large, green nut tree. Looking up, one traveler said, "This tree produces no sweet fruit; it is completely useless to us!" The tree moved its leaves gently and replied, "You sit in my cool shade, safe from the hot sun, yet you call me useless."', 'True value often lies in the silent, protective shields that guard our daily comfort and balance.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(54, 'Your little body is becoming aware of its surroundings, and you can feel the soft warmth of your home. I am gently holding my belly, letting you feel my warm, loving touch. I am always right here with you, my sweet baby.', 'Your father is placing his hand right here too, little soul. Can you feel our combined warmth? We are holding you close in our hearts every single hour of this journey.', 'The Man and the Lion\'s Statue', 'A fierce lion met a brave man in the jungle and boasted, "Look at my massive claws! I am the strongest creature here." The man led him to a large stone statue of a man winning a fight against a lion. "See? Man is stronger," the man said. The lion replied, "That was made by a man; a lion\'s story would be different."', 'Look beyond a single description; true balance requires understanding many different sides.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(55, 'Beautiful new connections are forming inside your amazing mind today, making your thoughts rich and bright. I am reading peaceful stories, speaking soft words, and keeping my heart full of joy for you. May you be blessed with immense wisdom.', 'You are going to be our absolute pride, little one. Your father is sending you thoughts of clarity, sharp intellect, and deep understanding today. Take your time and grow beautifully in your safe space.', 'The Ant and the Proud Elephant', 'A proud elephant always sprayed water on a colony of hardworking ants, laughing at their small size. One day, a small ant quietly crawled inside the elephant\'s trunk and began to bite gently. The giant elephant cried in pain, unable to stop it, and apologized. The ant crawled out, showing him that everyone has power when calm.', 'Respect every part of life, no matter how small; true power is always gentle and humble.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(56, 'Two whole months are complete, my precious baby! Look at the incredible milestone we have reached together. Your full structure is safely formed, and I am so ready and happy for the next beautiful phase ahead. God bless you, my child.', 'Two full months of knowing you are with us, my little child! Your father is filled with immense happiness today. We have successfully laid the foundation of your world, and we are ready for all the beautiful months ahead.', 'The Swan and the Boasting Crow', 'A proud crow challenged a swift white swan to a flying race over a deep ocean. The crow flew in wild loops, showing off his tricks, but quickly grew exhausted and lost his balance over the open water. His wings grew heavy. The gentle swan flew down, lifted the crow on his back, and carried him safely to land.', 'True capability is quiet, steady, and balanced; it serves to help others instead of showing off.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(57, 'My sweet baby, the foundation of your beautiful voice is forming today. I am speaking to you with the gentlest, most loving words, hoping my voice fills you with comfort. May your speech always be kind, true, and full of love.', 'I love talking to you, my little child. Your father promises to always listen to you, guide you with gentle words, and teach you to stand up for what is right. Your voice will bring so much joy to our home.', 'The Wise Monkey\'s Quick Escape', 'A clever monkey lived on a berry tree by a deep river and shared his fruit with a crocodile daily. One evening, the crocodile said, "Come to my home across the river for dinner so I can thank you." The monkey happily jumped onto his back. In the middle of the deep water, the crocodile said, "My wife wants to eat your sweet heart." The monkey\'s heart beat fast, but he kept his mind completely calm. He laughed and said, "Oh, why didn\'t you say so? I leave my heart safely in the hollow of my tree! Take me back quickly to grab it." The foolish crocodile turned around. The moment they touched the riverbank, the monkey leaped high into his branches, safe and sound.', 'A calm mind and sharp listening can instantly turn a difficult situation into a safe path home.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(58, 'Your arms and legs are growing longer and stronger today, preparing the world. I am keeping my body active, safe, and well-rested. I cannot wait for the day I hold your soft little hands. Feel my womb hugging you tightly.', 'Your father is waiting to hold you in his arms, my little baby. Every effort I make out in the world today is to ensure your tiny feet always walk on a safe, happy, and loving path. You are deeply loved.', 'The Three Wise Fish', 'Three fish lived in a clear stream. The first fish was wise, the second was smart, and the third was lazy. One evening, the wise fish heard fishermen planning to cast nets the next morning. Using his sharp mind, he swam away to a safer pool instantly. The smart fish stayed but pretended to be dead when the net caught him, and the fishermen threw him back. The lazy fish ignored the news and was caught.', 'Sharp awareness and processing what you hear protects you long before trouble arrives.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(59, 'Tiny, delicate nail beds are appearing on your beautiful little fingers and toes today. You are being crafted with such perfect detail. I am resting comfortably, letting my heart overflow with pure affection for you. You are my masterpiece.', 'You are our greatest joy, little one. Your father is sending you thoughts of grace and beauty today. Rest deeply in the quiet safety your mother is providing. I am right here watching over you both.', 'The Blue Jackal\'s Mistake', 'A jackal running away from a village fell into a big bucket of blue dye. Coming out entirely bright blue, the animals in the jungle thought he was a special king. The jackal enjoyed his luxury, ordering everyone around. One evening, a group of jackals began to howl in the distance. Forgetting his disguise, the blue jackal opened his mouth and howled along. The animals instantly heard the sound, realized his true self, and chased him away.', 'Pretending to be someone you are not never lasts; sharp minds always look past the surface to the true voice.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(60, 'Your tiny taste buds are starting to form today, preparing you to experience the flavors of life. I am eating healthy, clean, and delicious food, treating my body with deep care. Every bite is to give you long health and endless energy.', 'Your health is our greatest wealth, little one. Your father is making sure your mother gets the best care and the most peaceful environment. We are building a strong, healthy future for you, right from this moment.', 'The Monkey and the Wood Log', 'A group of woodcutters left a big log half-split on the ground, keeping it open with a wooden wedge block. A curious monkey jumped onto the log and began pulling at the wedge out of pure mischief. He kept pulling without thinking until the wedge popped out. The heavy log snapped shut instantly, trapping his tail. The monkey cried out, realizing his thoughtless curiosity had cost him his freedom.', 'Avoid meddling in things that are stable and require no interference; mindful observation preserves peace.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(61, 'Soft, delicate follicles are starting to shape across your skin today. You are becoming more unique every single second. I am breathing deeply, sending fresh oxygen and endless love down to you. You have everything you need to thrive.', 'You are deeply connected to both of us, my child. While your mother feeds your body, your father is here to feed your soul with safety, support, and protection. You are the center of our universe.', 'The Crane and the Clever Crab', 'An old crane tricked the fish of a small pond, promising to fly them to a larger lake, but ate them on a hill instead. A wise crab joined the next trip. Moving high in the air, the crab kept his mind completely calm. Seeing the fish bones on the hill, the crab locked his sharp claws around the crane’s neck, forcing him down safely back to the pond.', 'Greed and trickery always build a trap for the one who plans them; sharp minds see through deceit easily.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(62, 'Inside your quiet world, you are practicing your very first swallowing movements, learning to interact with your home. I am staying fully relaxed, peaceful, and content, knowing you are growing perfectly. You are doing so well, my child.', 'You are growing wiser and stronger every day, little baby. Your father is standing right beside your mother, keeping all stress away, making sure your tiny life flows with absolute ease and peace.', 'The Lion and the Clever Rabbit', 'A fierce lion hunted animals every single day, keeping the jungle in terror. The animals agreed to send one animal daily. When it was a tiny rabbit\'s turn, he used his mind and walked very slowly, arriving late. The angry lion roared, demanding an excuse. The rabbit said, "Another lion stopped me by a deep well!" Furious, the lion ran to the well. He looked down, saw his own reflection in the water, and jumped into the well, vanishing forever.', 'Intelligence, strategy, and sharp thinking will easily overcome brute, unthinking strength.'),
