  GarbhSheetDay(102, 'You are an extraordinary miracle and my absolute joy, my child. Fifteen magnificent weeks of our bond are successfully complete today. You are fierce, you are strong, and you are surrounded by a family that loves you beyond words.', 'Two weeks of knowing you are with us, my little one! Your father is growing braver and happier every day just thinking about you. We are building a beautiful life together, and we are so proud of you already.', 'The Two Flying Swans', 'Two beautiful white swans were flying across a vast, green valley to reach a safe lake. The younger swan looked at the long distance and grew worried. The mother swan flapped her wings gracefully and replied, "We do not fight the heavy sky, my child. We simply glide along with the warm, supportive wind of our shared love."', 'Walking your path with grace and love makes every single milestone look effortless and beautiful.'),
