  GarbhSheetDay(136, 'You are beautifully smooth, balanced, and graceful in your movements. Your actions are becoming steady and coordinated today. You carry great strength within you, your body is perfect, and you are resting in calm comfort.', 'Grow beautifully, step by step, my child. Your father is sending you thoughts of physical balance, grace, and power today. I am looking after your mother\'s rest so you get every single bit of energy.', 'The Musician and the Coordinated Beats', 'A young girl was learning to play the mridangam for a temple festival. In the beginning, her left hand and right hand moved at different speeds, creating an uneven sound. She slowed down, closed her eyes, and listened to the underlying rhythm. Soon, her hands moved in a perfectly smooth, balanced, and coordinated flow, creating an absolute harmony.', 'When your mind and actions work in smooth coordination, you move through life with absolute balance and ease.'),
