  GarbhSheetDay(141, 'You are an extraordinary masterpiece, detailed and perfect. Your beautiful facial features are completely set today. I am filling my heart with pure happiness, sending waves of total pride and love down to your quiet space.', 'I can already imagine your beautiful face, my child. Your father promises to always look at you with patience, guide your steps, and show you the absolute beauty of this world. You are our joy.', 'The Sculptor\'s Finishing Touch', 'A master sculptor was carving a sandstone statue for the city square. A student asked, "Why do you spend hours polishing the small details on the face that people can only see up close?" The master smiled and replied, "Every single fine line gives the face its true expression of grace. When you work with complete patience, the full masterpiece feels alive."', 'True beauty and grace are built step by step; taking care of every small detail makes your foundation complete.'),
