  GarbhSheetDay(175, 'You are my absolute pride, comfort, and joy, my sweet child! Twenty-six wonderful weeks of our unbroken bond are complete today. You are growing with incredible power, you are resilient, and you are infinitely blessed.', 'Twenty-six weeks of your beautiful existence are alive in our hearts, my child. Your father is overflowing with pride and love today. We are building a beautiful life for you, step by step.', 'Milestone: The Caravan at the Mountain Pass', 'A group of travelers completed twenty-six weeks of a long journey across the plains. Today, they reached a safe mountain shelter built tightly into the solid rock walls. The travelers dropped their heavy bags and rested comfortably by the warm fire, knowing they had successfully crossed the hardest paths of the road.', 'Every milestone crossed is a celebration of your incredible resilience, power, and steady progress.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(176, 'You are an unshakeable force of deep health and natural immunity. Your body is absorbing my natural shield of protection today. You are perfectly safe, your immune system is powerfully strong, and you are built for longevity.', 'Your health is our greatest wealth, little soul. Your father is standing right here, keeping all worries away from your mother, making sure your tiny life flows with absolute ease, peace, and comfort.', 'Hitopadesha: The Wise Crow\'s Warning', 'A young deer made friends with a jackal who secretly wanted to trap him. A wise old crow watched them from a high tree and sensed the danger. The crow flew down and warned the deer, "True friends protect you; they do not speak sweet lies to lead you into trouble." The deer listened, stayed away from the trap, and remained safe.', 'Listening to wise counsel and staying alert guards your path from unexpected difficulties.'),
  GarbhSheetDay(177, 'You are an incredibly smart, attentive, and wise listener. You can pick out my voice from the world with complete clarity today. You are surrounded by absolute harmony, your mind is peaceful, and our voice is your eternal comfort.', 'It is me, your father, speaking to you again. I want my voice to be your unshakeable symbol of safety, strength, and love from this day forward. Relax deeply; we are right here with you.', 'Tenali Rama and the Guard\'s Key', 'The king bought a heavy iron box to store the royal jewels and asked, "Is this lock enough to keep the treasure safe?" Tenali Rama smiled and replied, "My King, a heavy lock is good, but true safety depends on the smart mind of the guard who holds the key. Awareness is the real lock."', 'A calm mind and sharp awareness are the ultimate keys that keep your inner world secure.'),
