  GarbhSheetDay(183, 'You are a deeply connected, intuitive, and loved child. Your little mind holds the warm memory of our endless daily conversations today. You are safe, you are a radiant spark of pure joy, and your spirit is completely at peace.', 'I love speaking to you every day, my little child. Your father promises to always listen to you, guide you with gentle words, and show you the brightest, most cheerful side of life. Rest well.', 'Nature Metaphor: The Teak and the Vine', 'A beautiful flowering vine grew at the base of a giant teak tree in the jungle. The wind blew hard, trying to tear the soft leaves of the vine. The strong teak tree stood firm, holding the vine tightly against its trunk and shielding it from the heavy blast, allowing it to grow in safety.', 'You are beautifully supported, anchored, and surrounded by an endless, protective circle of love.'),
